    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66888" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταπορεύ-ομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go after, follow up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					31.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>pursue, punish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀποστήσαντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.88.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσέβειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.58.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.13.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>seek after, canvass for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.4.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολέμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.30
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Demetrias</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>change</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλήν, ἤθη</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aed.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεῖθρον</span>, of a river,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>go from one place to another, migrate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				904c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.129
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				44.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
